{"id":"vod_md_6183","vodId":"6183","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"安达与岛村","name_cn":"安达与岛村","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231023-1/9a9f51af2d8e5e5b683b3b1fa9bbfac6.jpg"},"summary":"安达樱（鬼头明里 配音）是学校里公认的不良少女，常常逃课偷懒。这一天，安达照例翘掉了无聊的体育课，却在体育馆二楼遇见了同样也翘了课的岛村抱月（伊藤美来 配音）。就这样，两个本来并不是太熟的女生开始了她们的交往，两人一起聊天、打保龄球、唱卡拉OK，她们都发现对方的身上有着和自己惊人相似的个性，喜好和对事物的看法也空前的一致。随着时间的推移，安达发现自己的眼神总是不受控制的锁定在岛村的身上，后者的一举一动竟然能让自己脸红心跳芳心大动，安达明白，自己对岛村怀有的感情早已经超越了友谊。那么，对于两人的关系，岛村是怎么想的呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-23 08:48:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/SN5Y84oH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/cOrisS85/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/8Lzfix30/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/E82ss3kH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/6zdeGVns/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/hbOVXtHY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/lFZ8ON3a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/PDpAWQoV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/PiTAnmIi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/gSsgYnSq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/CwOKAopm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/kuzDaqYf/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:36.392Z"}